    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to keep the engine running. \"mystery remains,\" \"it's humbling\"... it's just fluff to avoid the actual reality. the reality is that i've spent my entire life chasing something that doesn't exist. i look at my hands and i don't see a scientist, i just see a machine that's finished its cycle. there's no more \"unraveling\" to do. it's just empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
